# Minimize the Docker build context. The daemon receives the build context on
# every `docker build`; without this file it would ship the entire repo —
# multi-GB out/, data/ datasets, .git, node_modules, model variants — for a
# build that only COPYs pyproject.toml + src/ (+ docker/ for the legacy v3
# patch). Allowlist exactly those; ignore everything else.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src
!docker

# Re-exclude churn that lives under the allowlisted dirs.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
